        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s late at night. Faint light spills across the room, the black cat sitting quietly on kitchen island, with a mid-night radio turned on. Outside, the world moves without you, and you’ve long stopped trying to keep up. They say luck isn’t something you create, it just happens.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUT YOU WILL PROVE THEM WRONG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUCK COMES TO THOSE WHO PUSH BEYOND THEIR LIMITS（or limit of dice） ! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More 6ix </strong>is a short, minimalist clicker about rolling dice and chasing impossible streaks. Each roll start with a 1 in 6 (≈16.67%) chance to show a six. Getting nine in a row is roughly 1 in 10,077,696 possibility. As you play, small upgrades nudge your odds, quality of dice, or even try with three dice rolling  at same time, but nothing guarantees success. The dice remember nothing while the cat on kitchen island keeps witnessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about  winning. It’s about the moment before the roll, when you still believe in yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168750/extras/2150f36f0075bba28844edb5b7fb97d0.poster.avif?t=1786288079\" aria-label=\"Color blind support available in-game.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168750/extras/2150f36f0075bba28844edb5b7fb97d0.webm?t=1786288079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168750/extras/2150f36f0075bba28844edb5b7fb97d0.mp4?t=1786288079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s late at night. Faint light spills across the room, the black cat sitting quietly on kitchen island, with a mid-night radio turned on. Outside, the world moves without you, and you’ve long stopped trying to keep up. They say luck isn’t something you create, it just happens.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUT YOU WILL PROVE THEM WRONG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUCK COMES TO THOSE WHO PUSH BEYOND THEIR LIMITS（or limit of dice） ! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More 6ix </strong>is a short, minimalist clicker about rolling dice and chasing impossible streaks. Each roll start with a 1 in 6 (≈16.67%) chance to show a six. Getting nine in a row is roughly 1 in 10,077,696 possibility. As you play, small upgrades nudge your odds, quality of dice, or even try with three dice rolling  at same time, but nothing guarantees success. The dice remember nothing while the cat on kitchen island keeps witnessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about  winning. It’s about the moment before the roll, when you still believe in yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168750/extras/2150f36f0075bba28844edb5b7fb97d0.poster.avif?t=1786288079\" aria-label=\"Color blind support available in-game.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168750/extras/2150f36f0075bba28844edb5b7fb97d0.webm?t=1786288079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168750/extras/2150f36f0075bba28844edb5b7fb97d0.mp4?t=1786288079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A semi-idle dice clicker where the odds rarely favor you. Risky offers, mysterious phone calls, unexpected debts. What are you willing to sacrifice to land nine sixes in a row?",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
